$ jailops network create sw --ipv4 10.94.0.1/24 --uplink em0 --ipv6 2001:db8:1:2:100::/80
network/sw created
Grant it to a project with: jailops network grant sw --project main

$ jailops network ndp-proxy enable sw
network/sw updated
network/sw: the NDP proxy answers for 2001:db8:1:2:100::1-2001:db8:1:2:100::ffff on em0

$ jailops network create -f <dir>/sw2.yaml
network/sw2 created
Grant it to a project with: jailops network grant sw2 --project main
! note: on some shared IPv6 segments the setting net.inet6.icmp6.nd6_onlink_ns_rfc4861 matters (it is 0): https://jailops.net/articles/shared-ipv6-neighbor-discovery/#fix

$ jailops apply -f <dir>/sw3.yaml
network/sw3 created
! note: on some shared IPv6 segments the setting net.inet6.icmp6.nd6_onlink_ns_rfc4861 matters (it is 0): https://jailops.net/articles/shared-ipv6-neighbor-discovery/#fix

$ jailops network create rt --ipv6 2001:db8:1:2:1::1/80
network/rt created
Grant it to a project with: jailops network grant rt --project main

